# Personal milestones (Bots as people for 1.2, work package 6; docs/BOTS-AS-PEOPLE-1.2.md, item 6). A gamebot chases one
# goal at a time and says so as it gets close, in its group, /say, its guild or /faction (BotMilestoneLife). New writing.
# The truth rule: every number is a slot the server fills from the bot's real state. {level} its level; {bubbles} the
# bubbles left to 50 at level 49 (2-9); {count} for realm rank 5 the thousands of realm points left, for the trophy the
# high-end raid kills it was at without winning anything; {boss} the last such boss (or the one that dropped its trophy);
# {item} the item it really received from that boss's loot. A half line is said at 50% of the way or later, a close line
# at 90% or later, so "over halfway" and "almost" are true whenever they are said. No epic armour (owner decision 2), no
# artifacts (Trials of Atlantis), no realm rank 5 abilities: realm rank 5 is a title here, nothing more.

# ---- the ding to 50: halfway (level 45-49, at least half the experience from 45 to 50) ------------------------------
@kind milestone
@topic ding50_half
@who *
@levels 45-49
{level} now, [over halfway|past the halfway mark] to 50
[halfway|more than halfway] to 50. [the grind is real|slow going but getting there]
[over|past] halfway to 50 [finally|at last]. {level} and climbing
{level}, [the back half of the 40s|the long end of the 40s]. 50 is starting to look real
[halfway|half way] there. [50 here i come|cant wait for 50]
[ok|so] im past halfway to 50 now. [still a ways to go|plenty left to grind]
{level} and over halfway to 50, [cant stop now|no turning back]
@who Leveler
[over halfway|past halfway] to 50. [best xp of my life|camping hard]
math says im halfway to 50. {level}, back to the camp
@who Socialite
halfway to 50 [guys|all]! [someone throw a party|ill throw a party at 50]
@who NoLifer
[over halfway to 50|halfway to 50]. [no sleep till 50|sleep is for 50s]
@who Daredevil
halfway to 50 and [i havent died in a while|only died twice today]. [new record|not bad]
@who Explorer
{level} and halfway to 50. [still havent seen half the map|so many places left to see]
@who Crafter
halfway to 50, [then back to the forge|then i can craft in peace]

